{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_overview", "label": "Migrating from mocks.json to OpenAPI guide", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DevView 0.2.0 replaces mocks.json with OpenAPI 3.x and removes the environment axis entirely as a big-bang breaking change. mocks.json's environments[]+endpointOverrides existed to let one endpoint serve different paths/behaviour per deployment target, but that's exactly what OpenAPI's paths already models (one operation per path+method); modeling it a second time as a DevView-specific 'environment' concept was redundant, and OpenAPI tooling (editors, linters, codegen) doesn't understand mocks.json at all."}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_conversion_script", "label": "scripts/mocks_json_to_openapi.py conversion script", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_field_mapping", "label": "Field-by-field mapping table (mocks.json -> OpenAPI)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_environments", "label": "Environments -> servers[] collapse", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "endpointOverrides doesn't get a replacement feature because a path variant that used to live under one environment's override is just another paths entry with its own operationId in the same document. An override that changes only delayMs/name/queryParams (not path or method) has no OpenAPI equivalent, since one (path, method) pair is exactly one operation."}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_response_files", "label": "Response file declaration via examples.<name>.externalValue", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces the old directory-tier plus filename convention (with environment-specific files shadowing shared ones) with an explicit per-variant declaration in the spec; there is no probing of status codes or filename suffixes at runtime."}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_datastore_reset", "label": "One-shot DataStore key-shape migration on upgrade", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The operation-state key shape changed ({groupId}-{environmentId}-{endpointId} -> {specId}-{operationId}), and the persisted Mock payload changed (response file name -> (statusCode, exampleName)). On first launch after upgrading, every old-shape network_mock_endpoint_* entry is wiped once, since this is disabled-by-default developer-tooling state, not user data; the global mocking toggle is unaffected."}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_callsite_change", "label": "NetworkMock(...) call-site change (configPath -> resourceLoader+specPaths)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_worked_example", "label": "Worked example: sample-api staging/prod override -> two operations", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_epic72", "label": "GitHub epic worldline/devview#72", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_overview", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_core_overview", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_overview", "target": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_epic72", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_environments", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_core_versiontags", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_overview", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_core_xdevviewextension", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_datastore_reset", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_core_datastoreschema", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_guides_migrating_to_openapi_overview", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_overview", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/guides/migrating-to-openapi.md",